comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-09T20:06:55.015Z",codex-agent,"Continuation: retained the existing uncommitted sync and closeout edits. No remote task branch or PR exists. Auditing all workflow_call jobs and the dispatch/landing contracts before focused verification."
  "2026-11-09T20:09:30.888Z",codex-agent,"Class audit: both reusable sync and closeout dispatch steps contained the long PR/ancestry monitor; removed both. Dependabot has bounded API retries with no run polling and already has a job timeout. Added 60-minute sync/closeout job limits and five-minute dispatch caps; sync alerts retain 10 minutes. Before gh --auto, one-time repository setting and protected-base reads prevent immediate unprotected landing. Unknown metadata exits with a reason. Retained App-only unattended merging, scoped tokens, owned PR checks, closeout attribution holds/revocation, publication gates and parked-run reporting. A later schedule rebuilds/retries; persistent configuration problems need a maintainer."
  "2026-11-09T20:11:34.716Z",codex-agent,"Revert proof in a disposable copy: replaced only the sync/closeout Dispatch caller CI and report parked runs blocks with HEAD baseline blocks, leaving current tests and job timeouts. node --test --test-concurrency=2 --test-name-pattern=\"armed auto-merge is requested exactly once|unavailable auto-merge reports|the dispatch step shell never sleeps|fallback without merging or polling\" test/bot-pr-workflow.test.ts exited 1: all 18 selected regressions failed (0 passed). Separately removed only the two new job timeout-minutes declarations with fixed dispatch: the every job in the reusable workflows contract exited 1 (1 failed). The package worktree stayed fixed throughout; the fixed focused contract suite passed 117/117 after these source changes. Build, build:test, typecheck and lint passed. No full release gate was run locally; CI owns it."
  "2026-11-09T20:13:34.077Z",codex-agent,"Linked tests were executed through the pinned pm test command with --run --progress against a scratch copy of the tracker, using schema context and the source workspace. Result: 117/117 passed, no failures or skips. Scratch storage kept test-run artifacts out of the package tracker. A first invocation with none/source context was refused by the documented context constraint before execution; retrying with schema/source passed."
  "2026-11-09T20:14:09.943Z",codex-agent,"The source-workspace privacy gate also passed: 9140 Git objects audited with approved identities and no secret or host-path findings. The focused contracts cover App-only landing, disabled repository auto-merge, absent/unknown base protection, parked-run URLs and the five-minute dispatch limit. Caller templates keep release SHA pins and existing configuration; adopting the fix requires their normal pin update."
  "2026-11-09T20:16:21.432Z",codex-agent,"Final local verification: focused contract command passed 117/117; NPM_CONFIG_USERCONFIG=/dev/null node --test --test-concurrency=2 --test-name-pattern=\"earlier armed auto-merge|previous auto-merge is revoked|ambiguous deliveries open\" test/closeout-workflow.test.ts passed all 11 selected tests with no skips. npm run build, npm run build:test, npm run typecheck, npm run lint and npm run changelog:check passed. Strict tracker health with --no-extensions passed (only pre-existing stale-item advisories). Extension-enabled local health is blocked by extension_host_pm_cli_version_skew:2026.11.4:2026.11.8:pm-github; no dependency pin changed. CI must certify the full gate on the pushed head. Revert proof is recorded above; no new upstream PM CLI or SDK defect was found."
